{"seq":2,"slug":"knots-in-physics","title":"物理与量子不变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/practice/knots-in-physics","wordCount":1711,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"物理与量子不变量\">物理与量子不变量</h1><p>纽结理论诞生于开尔文一个错误的物理猜想，之后近一个世纪与物理毫无瓜葛。1988 年，Edward Witten 让它以一种谁也没预料的方式回到物理——而且这次是对的。他用量子场论重新解释了 Jones 多项式，证明这个纯组合定义的<a href=\"../invariants/knot-polynomials\">多项式</a>其实是一个三维量子场论的可观测量。更惊人的是，这条线一路延伸到今天的拓扑量子计算：某些二维系统里的准粒子在互相绕行时，会像编辫子一样「编织」，而这个编织过程天然地在计算纽结不变量。纽结从数学家的玩具，变成了容错量子计算机的物理蓝图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-chern-simons-与-jones-多项式\">核心概念：Chern–Simons 与 Jones 多项式</h2><p>Witten 的洞见是：给三维空间配一个 <strong>Chern–Simons 规范场论</strong>（作用量是规范场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Chern–Simons 泛函，只依赖拓扑、不依赖度量），然后计算一条沿纽结 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <strong>Wilson 圈</strong>（把规范场沿纽结绕一圈求迹）的量子期望值。这个期望值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle W_K \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>——一个物理观测量——恰好等于该纽结的 Jones 多项式（在合适的群 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SU(2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和参数下）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle W_K \\rangle \\;=\\; V_K(t), \\qquad t = e^{2\\pi i /(k+2)},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是场论的「层级」（level，一个整数耦合常数）。因为 Chern–Simons 理论不含度量、只依赖底流形的拓扑，它是一个 <strong>拓扑量子场论</strong>（TQFT）。这给了 Jones 多项式一个内蕴的三维解释——不再需要靠<a href=\"../foundations/reidemeister-moves\">Reidemeister 移动</a>逐项核验的组合定义，而是量子场论的自然产物。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[三维 Chern-Simons 场论] --&gt; B[沿纽结 K 的 Wilson 圈]&#10;    B --&gt; C[量子期望值 W_K]&#10;    C --&gt; D[等于 Jones 多项式 V_K t]&#10;    A --&gt; E[二维边界 共形场论]&#10;    E --&gt; F[非阿贝尔任意子]&#10;    F --&gt; G[辫子编织 = 幺正变换]&#10;    G --&gt; H[拓扑量子计算]&#10;    G --&gt; I[编织轨迹 = 纽结 → 算出不变量]\">flowchart TD\n    A[三维 Chern-Simons 场论] --&gt; B[沿纽结 K 的 Wilson 圈]\n    B --&gt; C[量子期望值 W_K]\n    C --&gt; D[等于 Jones 多项式 V_K t]\n    A --&gt; E[二维边界 共形场论]\n    E --&gt; F[非阿贝尔任意子]\n    F --&gt; G[辫子编织 = 幺正变换]\n    G --&gt; H[拓扑量子计算]\n    G --&gt; I[编织轨迹 = 纽结 → 算出不变量]</pre><h2 id=\"任意子与辫子群\">任意子与辫子群</h2><p>三维世界里粒子只有玻色子、费米子两类：交换两个全同粒子，波函数至多变号。但在<strong>二维</strong>里可以有第三种——<strong>任意子</strong>（anyon）：交换它们，波函数乘一个任意相位（阿贝尔任意子），甚至乘一个矩阵（非阿贝尔任意子）。关键在于二维中「交换」有了历史依赖性：两个粒子绕来绕去的世界线，在「二维空间 + 一维时间」里画出的正是一束<strong>辫子</strong>（braid）。</p>\n<p>于是二维任意子系统天然由<strong>辫群</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 支配，而辫群与纽结血脉相连：把一束辫子的两端接起来（取迹闭包）就得到一个纽结或链环。上一篇<a href=\"../structure/knot-group\">纽结群</a>里三叶结群 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle x,y\\mid xyx=yxy\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系，正是辫群 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的编织关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_1\\sigma_2\\sigma_1 = \\sigma_2\\sigma_1\\sigma_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——纽结、辫子、任意子三者由同一个代数关系串起。对<strong>非阿贝尔任意子</strong>，每次编织对应一个作用在简并基态空间上的幺正矩阵，而把编织轨迹闭合起来算它的迹，得到的正是对应纽结的 Jones 多项式（在特定层级下）。物理系统在「编织」，数学上就是在算纽结不变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拓扑量子计算\">拓扑量子计算</h2><p>这套图景的工程价值在于<strong>容错</strong>。普通量子比特娇气，任何局部噪声都会破坏它存的信息。但非阿贝尔任意子把量子信息存在<strong>全局拓扑</strong>里——存在一群任意子彼此绕行的方式（编织的同伦类）中，而不在任何单个粒子的局部状态里。局部扰动改变不了辫子的拓扑，信息因此天然受保护。计算的方式就是按预定顺序编织任意子，每个编织是一个量子门；下表对比这与常规量子计算的差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>常规量子比特</th>\n<th>拓扑量子比特（任意子）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信息存储</td>\n<td>单粒子局部态</td>\n<td>多任意子全局拓扑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量子门</td>\n<td>精确调控脉冲</td>\n<td>编织任意子（拓扑操作）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗噪</td>\n<td>需大量纠错开销</td>\n<td>拓扑保护，内在抗局部噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数学对象</td>\n<td>幺正矩阵</td>\n<td>辫群表示 = 纽结不变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>已规模化</td>\n<td>物理实现仍在攻关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最被看好的载体是 <strong>Majorana 零模</strong>（一种自身即反粒子的准粒子，成对出现在拓扑超导体两端，信息编码在它们的「费米子宇称」里）。2025 年 2 月微软发布 <strong>Majorana 1</strong> 芯片，宣称是首个以拓扑核心为基础的量子处理器（八量子比特），配套一篇 Nature 论文讲 InAs–Al 器件的单发宇称测量（<a href=\"https://news.ucsb.edu/2025/021760/topological-quantum-processor-marks-breakthrough-computing\">来源：UCSB / Microsoft Majorana 1, 2025</a>）。但学界对「是否真的实现了拓扑量子比特」高度审慎：多位研究者指出至今没有任何团队演示出确凿的拓扑量子比特，微软的证据也受到反复质疑，2026 年 6 月仍有公开争议（<a href=\"https://hackaday.com/2026/06/30/microsofts-topological-quantum-computing-claims-once-again-in-question/\">来源：Hackaday, 2026-06-30</a>）。真实进展与炒作在这里需要小心区分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从统计物理到量子近似算法\">从统计物理到量子近似算法</h2><p>纽结与物理的联系不止 TQFT 一条。Jones 多项式与统计物理里的 <strong>Potts 模型</strong>配分函数是同一个对象的两面——纽结图的交叉对应格点的相互作用，这解释了为什么精确计算 Jones 多项式和精确计算配分函数一样是 #P-难的（见<a href=\"../invariants/knot-polynomials\">纽结多项式</a>）。反过来，正因为它难，量子计算给出一条捷径：Aharonov–Jones–Landau 算法证明，在特定单位根处<strong>近似</strong>计算 Jones 多项式是 BQP-完全的——也就是说，这个纽结不变量的近似估值恰好刻画了量子计算机相对经典计算机的全部能力。纽结不变量既是量子计算的物理蓝图（任意子编织），又是它的算法标尺（BQP-完全问题）。这些精确 vs 近似、经典 vs 量子的复杂度分野，是<a href=\"computational-knot\">计算纽结理论</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Witten（1988）用 Chern–Simons 拓扑量子场论把 Jones 多项式解释为 Wilson 圈的量子期望值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle W_K\\rangle = V_K(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>二维任意子的交换有历史依赖，其世界线成辫子；辫群与纽结（辫闭包）同源，三叶结群即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 编织关系。</li>\n<li>非阿贝尔任意子编织给出作用在简并基态上的幺正矩阵，其闭合迹即 Jones 多项式；信息存于全局拓扑，天然抗噪。</li>\n<li>微软 2025 年 Majorana 1 芯片是拓扑量子计算的最新硬件，但「是否已实现拓扑量子比特」学界至 2026 年仍存重大争议。</li>\n<li>近似计算 Jones 多项式是 BQP-完全的，纽结不变量因而既是量子计算蓝图又是其能力标尺。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Wilson 圈期望值等于的那个多项式：<a href=\"../invariants/knot-polynomials\">纽结多项式 (Jones/Alexander)</a></li>\n<li>三叶结群与辫群 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的同一关系：<a href=\"../structure/knot-group\">纽结群</a></li>\n<li>不变性的组合定义与三种移动：<a href=\"../foundations/reidemeister-moves\">Reidemeister 移动</a></li>\n<li>精确 vs 近似计算的复杂度分野：<a href=\"computational-knot\">计算纽结理论</a></li>\n<li>跨库：辫群作为群论对象的一般背景见<a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/groups/group-definition\">抽象代数 · 群的定义</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"物理与量子不变量","id":"物理与量子不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：Chern–Simons 与 Jones 多项式","id":"核心概念-chern-simons-与-jones-多项式"},{"level":2,"text":"任意子与辫子群","id":"任意子与辫子群"},{"level":2,"text":"拓扑量子计算","id":"拓扑量子计算"},{"level":2,"text":"从统计物理到量子近似算法","id":"从统计物理到量子近似算法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"DNA 与生物","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/practice/knots-in-biology"},"next":{"title":"计算纽结理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/knot-theory/practice/computational-knot"}}